{"id":22882813814958,"type":"artist","name":"Cat Stevens","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":28,"info":{"country":"GB","kind":"Person","similar":["Paul Simon","Simon & Garfunkel","James Taylor","Van Morrison","Jackson Browne","Gordon Lightfoot","Crosby, Stills, Nash & Young","Neil Diamond","Crosby, Stills & Nash","Yusuf"],"disambiguation":"photographer","bio":"Yusuf Islam (21 de julio 1948, Londres - ) es un artista británico más conocido como Cat Stevens. Nació con el nombre Stephen Demetre Georgiou, hijo de madre sueca y de padre greco-chipriota. Cuando tenía 8 años, sus padres se separaron pero siguieron conviviendo como familia en la misma casa. Habitaban el piso superior del restaurante de su propiedad, donde todos trabajaban.\n\nSu primer instrumento musical fue el gran piano que había en la casa.","tags":["folk","singer-songwriter","classic rock","acoustic","rock"],"img":null},"works":[{"id":220950390657762,"type":"work","name":"I Love My Dog","artist":"Cat Stevens","year":1966,"weight":6,"yt":"ET5drt_utUY","src":"books","from":{"books":[{"name":"1966","title":"1966: The Year the Decade Exploded (Jon Savage)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[],"n_lists":0}},{"id":240432716731220,"type":"work","name":"Portobello Road","artist":"Cat Stevens","year":1966,"weight":6,"yt":"sZUbi8serW8","src":"books","from":{"books":[{"name":"1966","title":"1966: The Year the Decade Exploded (Jon Savage)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[],"n_lists":0}},{"id":232528977502859,"type":"album","name":"Mona Bone Jakon","artist":"Cat Stevens","year":1970,"weight":7,"yt":"cKzBuco8QS0","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":108997246366764,"name":"RYM Top — Folk — Chamber Folk","rank":67,"scaruffi":null},{"id":136210250045982,"name":"RYM Top — Pop — Folk Pop","rank":52,"scaruffi":null},{"id":233564640149435,"name":"RYM Top — Scenes & Movements — Second British Folk Revival","rank":71,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":3}},{"id":47859959385244,"type":"album","name":"Tea for the Tillerman