:"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","page":252,"text":"…Los Angeles-based vocalist and pianist Tori Amos (3) fused Kate Bush's operatic falsetto, Joni Mitchell's piano-based confessional odes and Cat Stevens' romantic piano figures on Little Earthquakes (1991). Its ballads were simple but profound, personal but universal, melodic but discordant, thus…"}],"podcast":[],"awards":[{"kind":"award","title":"Rock and Roll Hall of Fame (2014)","body":"Won.","year":2014,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Wikidata","episode":null,"url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q179191"}]},{"kind":"award","title":"honorary doctor of the University of Exeter","body":"Won.","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Wikidata","episode":null,"url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q104767284"}]}],"concerts":[],"xref":[],"charts":[{"id":47859959385244,"type":"album","name":"Tea for the Tillerman","work_year":1970,"list_id":192934750972716,"list":"1001 Albums You Must Hear Before You Die","src":"charts","rank":197,"year":1970,"note":null,"yt":"YrKAe4d46mk","scaruffi":null},{"id":47859959385244,"type":"album","name":"Tea for the Tillerman","list_id":3080531282495,"list":"AOTY Must Hear 1970s","src":"musthear","rank":230,"year":1970,"note":null,"yt":"YrKAe4d46mk","scaruffi":null},{"id":47859959385244,"type":"album","name":"Tea for the Tillerman","list_id":94905110718967,"list":"RYM Top — Folk","src":"musthear","rank":137,"year":1970,"note":null,"yt":"YrKAe4d46mk","scaruffi":null},{"id":232528977502859,"type":"album","name":"Mona Bone Jakon","list_id":108997246366764,"list":"RYM Top — Folk — Chamber Folk","src":"musthear","rank":67,"year":1970,"note":null,"yt":"cKzBuco8QS0","scaruffi":null},{"id":47859959385244,"type":"album","name":"Tea for the Tillerman","list_id":87310548737747,"list":"RYM Top — Folk — Contemporary Folk","src":"musthear","rank":132,"year":1970,"note":null,"yt":"YrKAe4d46mk","scaruffi":null},{"id":47859959385244,"type":"album","name":"Tea for the Tillerma